EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I'm kinda the town's unofficial{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
representative,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} so I really need
to make this place sound good!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ben kasabanın gayriresmî{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
temsilcisi gibiyim,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} o yüzden burayı
çok iyi anlatmam lazım!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Cioè, perché nessuno mi ha detto
che avremmo avuto visite?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
Casa mia è troppo un disastro!

FR:
Le monde entier rêve de venir
admirer un spécimen {{TAG:000E:000A:0600640065002000040064002700}}{{TAG:0005:0001:}}
dans son habitat naturel, mdr !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hai già fatto quattro chiacchiere
con i visitatori,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Dobbiamo essere ospitali, ricordalo!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Misafirimizle konuştun mu,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Artık zarif ev sahibi rolünü
oynama vakti!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}I wonder if they have any plans{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
to move here in the future! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Time
to investigate{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} the possibilities!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Acaba ileride{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} buraya taşınmayı
düşünürler mi! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Olasılıkları{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
araştırma zamanı!
